pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: the wrapped watcher slack needs no unusual number in the formula at all.
% Two legal `pol <id> <n> -` steps lower the right-hand sides to -9223372036854775806, which
% makes both derived constraints trivially true; their true slack 2^63 wrapped to i64::MIN,
% so each of them claimed to propagate all of its literals -- x1 from one and ~x1 from the
% other -- and the level-zero trail conflicted. The formula is satisfiable (all three
% variables true).
f 2 ;
pol 1 9223372036854775807 - ;
pol 2 9223372036854775807 - ;
rup >= 1 ;
output NONE;
conclusion UNSAT : 5 ;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
